fxaa.frag is an independent implementation, written for this project, of the FXAA 3.11
algorithm published by Timothy Lottes at NVIDIA: one luma-edge blend. It is not a copy
of NVIDIA's FXAA3_11.h. The one FXAA option uses the published quality preset 15,
whose edge search takes 8 steps.

The algorithm is described in Timothy Lottes, "FXAA", NVIDIA, 2009-2012.
NVIDIA's FXAA3_11.h is Copyright (c) 2010-2012 NVIDIA Corporation. All rights reserved.
